    "notes": "The fed's own flagship annual event, billed \"the Big Dance.\" A nine-match card: a Submission Match, a Cage Match, an Iron Will Match with a guest referee, a brutal Strap Match, a Triple Threat Table Match for the Cruiserweight Championship, a Crowbar-On-A-Pole Match for the United States Championship, a Ladder Match for the North American Championship, a World Tag Team Championship match ended by disqualification when Dominion and Minions of Darkness ran in, and a nine-fall main event -- decided by three consecutive pinfalls, by pin or submission -- in which The Executive retains the World Championship over Jack McGriff. Afterward, Jake Rockwell attacks ally The Executive with a crowbar, dissolves their own SyndiCorp alliance on air, and declares himself a World Championship contender.",
